// matrix, then refreshes transforms. Processes one hundred stride-0x18 triples through
// Gfx_TransformTriangleReturnDepthAlt and draws each primitive whose result flags lack mask 0x60000, writing fixed
// primitive words into the render state. Saves that state as the list head; when unpaused advances
// and retires at forty-one or above.
